  "pinned": false,
  "description": "**DailyChart.vue Enhancement \u2014 Single Day Bar Mode**\n\n1. The component renders a multi-line SVG chart (total/input/output tokens + cost) with hover tooltips, dual Y-axes, and responsive sizing via `ResizeObserver`\n2. A user request was made to display **bars instead of lines** when only one day of data is available\n3. A `isSingleDay` computed property was added to detect the single-point edge case, and `singleDayBars` computed builds 4 centered `<rect>` bar descriptors using the appropriate scales\n4. The SVG template was split into two branches: `v-if=\"isSingleDay\"` for grouped bars with value labels, and `v-else` preserving the original line/area chart\n5. The `onMouseMove` handler was also adapted to short-circuit in bar mode, always pinning the tooltip to the single data point without positional math",
